path":"ui_kits/first-run/index.html","group":"Authoring app","viewport":"1440x900","subtitle":"Drop → account wall → the article assembling behind the clarification questions → the editor","name":"First run"},{"path":"guidelines/brand-lockups.html","group":"Brand","viewport":"900x210","subtitle":"The i is the bolt. In the wordmark it keeps its green; alone it takes currentColor.","name":"Logo lockups"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-accent.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"900x170","subtitle":"Only the logo's colour in v1. Now it means completion: published, ready, finished.","name":"Accent — the bolt green, promoted"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-brand.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"900x180","subtitle":"Deep teal at a fixed oklch hue of 205. Only lightness and chroma move.","name":"Brand ramp"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-dark.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"900x240","subtitle":"Warm near-black, never blue-black. Depth switches from shadow to surface lightness plus a 1px inner light.","name":"Dark theme"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-ink.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"900x170","subtitle":"Still warm (hue 60) but a tenth of v1's chroma — the fix for borders that felt very 2000s","name":"Ink ladder"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-semantic.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"900x200","subtitle":"Each is a tinted surface plus an ink — never a fill with a border around it","name":"Semantic tones"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-surfaces.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"900x180","subtitle":"Lightness IS the separation. There is no --border token in v2 — this ladder replaced it.","name":"Surface ladder"},{"path":"components/brand/brand.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"900x300","subtitle":"The bolt keeps its green in the wordmark; alone it takes currentColor","name":"Brand — wordmark, bolt, micro-label, theme toggle"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"900x420","subtitle":"No borders. Hover deepens the fill and lifts one elevation step; press settles 1.5%.","name":"Core — buttons, icon buttons, segmented, switch, chips, icons"},{"path":"components/data/data.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"900x520","subtitle":"State is a glyph and a label, never a dot in a pill","name":"Data — state, rows, groups, cards, thumbs, progress"},{"path":"components/feedback/feedback.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"900x520","subtitle":"Tinted surfaces instead of bordered banners; the toolbar owns the top z-layer","name":"Feedback — notices, sheet, menu, floating toolbar"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"900x460","subtitle":"Filled at rest, lifted on focus. The dashed dropzone is gone.","name":"Forms — fields, select, textarea, dropzone"},{"path":"guidelines/elevation-focus.html","group":"Elevation","viewport":"900x220","subtitle":"Fields sink at rest and rise on focus. Nothing recolours a border, because nothing has one.","name":"Focus & control states"},{"path":"guidelines/elevation-radii.html","group":"Elevation","viewport":"900x170","subtitle":"More generous than v1 — the cheapest single lever on whether something feels modern","name":"Corner radii"},{"path":"guidelines/elevation-shadows.html","group":"Elevation","viewport":"900x220","subtitle":"Every shadow is 2–3 stops: a contact shadow for the edge, a mid lift, a wide ambient","name":"Elevation replaces borders"},{"path":"ui_kits/marketing/index.html","group":"Marketing site","viewport":"1280x820","subtitle":"Hero, three-step how-it-works, legal footer — plus the log-in modal","name":"Landing page"},{"path":"guidelines/motion.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"900x210","subtitle":"One spring for size and position. No spinner, no pulsing dot, no looping shimmer.","name":"Motion budget"},{"path":"guidelines/states-row.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"900x230","subtitle":"Full-bleed hover fill and a chevron that fades in. No indent-on-hover — that was a v1 tic.","name":"Row states"},{"path"